<title>UK: Banco Mercantil Argentino sets $50 million bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Mercantil Argentino sets $50 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO MERCANTIL ARGENTINO</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+255 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX/BA    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AR GOV LAW     NEW YORK</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT UST</p>
<p> NOTES	TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
